  "description": "When Kim Tae-Wun sneaks onto a film set to find his twin sister - an avid fan and fansite master of idol-turned-actor Lee Hae-Seo - he ends up running right into the star himself. The problem? Hae-Seo just happens to be in the middle of an uncontrollable rut cycle. In a whirlwind of chaos, Tae-Woon helps him through it, only to bolt like Cinderella at midnight. Now, with no idea who his mysterious savior was, Hae-Seo takes to social media to track him down… and Tae-Wun’s quiet life is about to get very, very noisy.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
